  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Sending a file\"\nslug: \"/apps/desktop-sending-a-file--mzk5c5g9pe8qbyvndhgitl3t\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"Desktop\",\"General\",\"desktop\",\"working-with-chats\"]\n---\n\nTo send a file:\n\n1. Open the chat with the person you want to send the file to.\n2. Click on the![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/88f647d88efbffa6b9e1/8a49c95a4a3b7f56a8f65e02e00f5adc435dcded4ea21f2333b1d9a6f3e250b8.png)icon at the right side of the **Message Input Area**.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/2c06cbff059902aec600/b9ef4e3c87f55815df5d0e4bf5712c46d9e5a27b1739b33c230768ace0b8aef1.png)\n\n1. Choose a file you would like to send.\n\nYou can also use **drag-n-drop&#x20;**&#x74;o send files into a chat and send files, images, and text from your clipboard by pressing **Ctrl-V&#x20;**&#x69;n the **Message Input Area**.\n"
